    "title": "Victoria's Secret PINK Apparel",
    "description": "Description Body:\r\n\r\nWelcome to the PINK APP: your destination for discovering new trends, exclusive offers, *tons* of cute styles, and more. We literally have it all, from comfy stay-in basics to eye-catching go-out looks. With Bras, Panties, Apparel, Activewear, and Swimwear (not to mention Beauty + Accessories) in sizes ranging from XS-XXL, there\u2019s a lot of something for everyone. Interested? Here\u2019s some other cool stuff we\u2019ve got going on:  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSMOOTH CHECKOUT\r\n\r\nSave your payment method for streamlined transactions, instantly manage your bills, and more (also, personalize your profile for future reference). \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCUTTING-EDGE TOOLS\r\n\r\n\u2026like Verifyt, by Netvirta\u2014a new 3D-scanning technology that helps you find your bra fit from the comfort of anywhere in just a few clicks. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nJUST-FOR-YOU CONTENT \r\n\r\nTake outfit quizzes, snag special offers, view behind-the-scenes campaign videos, and other fun bonuses for your eyes only.  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMEMBERS-ONLY PERKS\r\n\r\nJoin VS & PINK Rewards to earn points with every purchase, which turn into treats like Free Shipping and $$ Off your next order. Plus, you\u2019ll have access to our exclusive Community\u2014a space to create, connect, and get inspired.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLike what you see? Then you\u2019re gonna LOVE us. Follow along on social @vspink, and we\u2019ll catch you online",
